<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fruit of the Loom cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fruit of the Loom cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it downgraded Fruit of the Loom Inc to buy from strong buy and removed the stock from its &quot;Focus List.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock of Fruit of the Loom dropped 1-3/8 to 32-1/2 after being delayed in opening on the New York Stock Exchange due to an imbalance of orders.</p>
</text>
